'''Garel City''' was a [[city]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Garel]]. It was the location of the [[Garel City Spaceport]].<ref name="Droids in Distress" /> The Leonis and Spanjaf families lived there under false identities after the rescue of [[Dhara Leonis]] from [[Project Harvester]].<ref name="secret">''[[Servants of the Empire: The Secret Academy]]''</ref> The city became a refuge and temporary base for the rebel cell [[Phoenix Cell]] after they were driven away from [[Lothal]].<ref name="bloodsisters">{{Rebels|Blood Sisters}}</ref> The city sustained damage when Phoenix Squadron was [[Battle of Garel|forced to flee]] the planet after the [[Galactic Empire|Empire]] learned of the rebels' presence there.<ref name="Legacy">{{Rebels|Legacy (episode)}}</ref>

